WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:02.000
What is two plus two?

00:02.000 --> 00:06.890
Two plus two is four.

00:06.890 --> 00:08.890
Alexa.

00:08.890 --> 00:13.650
What is the integral of x squared?

00:13.650 --> 00:18.650
The integral of x squared is x cubed over three, plus a constant.

00:18.650 --> 00:19.650
Alexa.

00:19.650 --> 00:23.920
[A voice command for audio playback.]

00:23.920 --> 00:33.500
[The voice assistant announces a radio station, then music plays.]
